# Callback from the notation browser: takes the chosen path as source,
# writes it to the log and redraws.

Calculate cSourcePath as $cinst.$shortPath(pTargetPath) ## the browser returns $fullname
Set reference iSourceRef to iTools.$pathToRefQuiet(cSourcePath) ## silent, reads Lib.Class, like $setTargetPathCallback
Do $cinst.$logSetValues()
Do $cinst.$redraw()